WEBVTT

00:01:58.573 --> 00:02:00.783
is what we call “blissing out.”

00:02:01.784 --> 00:02:05.288
Looking for peace, calm, joy,

00:02:05.329 --> 00:02:06.747
relax.

00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:08.124
(Laughter)

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:11.627
The more you look for relax,

00:02:11.669 --> 00:02:14.463
then peace, calm, joy, relax run away.

00:02:14.505 --> 00:02:15.631
So ...

00:02:17.008 --> 00:02:19.093
Let me share [with] you my own experience.

00:02:19.093 --> 00:02:21.304
When I was young, I had panic attacks.

00:02:21.345 --> 00:02:25.266
Although I was born right in the middle
of the Himalayan mountains,

00:02:25.308 --> 00:02:27.852
the area, the village, wonderful,

00:02:27.894 --> 00:02:30.396
but panic followed me like a shadow.